 to ProgramData folder"],["description","All three dropped files were then moved to a new folder \u201cC:ProgramDataMicrosoft Malware ProtectionGHQ\u201d"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0005","technique":"T1070.010"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--878d252f-de04-5857-ad0a-e8560794a9aa","120":"instance--bf65c103-2305-50be-8098-7718a8b010c5","150":"instance--348f71b8-78ee-5edf-accb-cd536c0db67d","180":"instance--e786d536-88e4-5ad4-8526-ae120c505f45","210":"instance--d3f3806c-3238-5b69-a0ca-334a1453e3dd","240":"instance--6dc42515-8e0a-5d8f-9dcb-cc6f0eb80f24","270":"instance--6a335c70-0c01-578c-9e01-614ace562750","30":"instance--c34e4c14-a710-535c-afd4-17d8ea759e88","300":"instance--60b19ce6-d4d3-5ce5-b2fe-3427fd0ea9a4","330":"instance--dea41a44-5c5a-520f-8975-25088fdd166c","60":"instance--e8f2f47b-1824-589b-af23-ab4291258936","90":"instance--67989025-38e3-56c8-b903-f474fc067511"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--16","properties":[["name","Abuse ESET executable for DLL hijacking"],["description","The \u201c3.exe\u201d is a legitimate executable and it is signed by \u201cESET, spol. s r.o.\u201d and it is being abused for DLL hijacking technique to execute http_dll.dll which decodes and loads the malicious payload http_dll.dat."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0004","technique":"T1574.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--dbfe6415-cd2c-55f2-9509-06b6668ef23a","120":"instance--79ca45e2-afd7-51fa-9574-5085c7de4c84","150":"instance--39171cfe-3bf6-5200-b6f5-e97e3b047db7","180":"instance--8cda146b-7259-56b2-b337-56038a1f52d3","210":"instance--a662f8bf-2723-58c0-a1a8-9af9497cf428","240":"instance--a9b75b15-3be0-5e64-8132-40b87e7ae405","270":"instance--31896ecd-322b-5a41-bd1e-0b7a30b9d9d1","30":"instance--60868276-2726-597d-8f57-8aa7fc9c0738","300":"instance--4f5668fa-b6ef-57cc-93da-5cd1e1727a22","330":"instance--b022a562-9020-587c-a5be-97d254cc8f11","60":"instance--cf452b0f-192e-5357-ba8c-fbae1a6e4ae0","90":"instance--012cc6fc-0a37-5e6e-b9b7-07f3bcd2d02c"}